  // its age, which inflates the effective boost for any lower-mileage generated ad).
  // Retested against both real player-provided listings WITH mileage included this time:
  // 2010 Travego 17 (its own real 1,424,978km) → ₺3.77M (target ~4.0M, safely under, not
  // over); 2008 Cityliner (its own real 2,182,067km) → ₺1.66M (target ~2.0M, same margin
